Description: slicer, layout editor and streaming controller for pen plotters
 LINTO prepares vector graphics for HP-GL pen plotters: it places SVG and
 HP-GL artwork on the sheet with the plotter's real margins, optimizes pen
 paths, simulates the whole plot on screen and streams it to the plotter over
 RS-232 or TCP with hardware flow control.
